</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S4.T1.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:227.7pt;">
